      <title>Squeak 2.29.0</title>
      <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 06:19:22 +0000</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>22900</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>2.29.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description><![CDATA[<!DOCTYPE html><html><head><meta charset="utf-8"><style>html{color-scheme:light dark}body{font:13px/1.5 -apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'SF Pro Text',system-ui,sans-serif;color:#18181b;background:transparent;margin:0;padding:4px 2px}ul{margin:0 0 10px;padding-left:18px}li{margin:0 0 6px}p{margin:0 0 10px}h4{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#52525b;margin:16px 0 6px;padding-top:10px;border-top:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.08)}code{font:12px ui-monospace,'SF Mono',monospace;background:rgba(0,0,0,.06);padding:1px 4px;border-radius:6px}@media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){body{color:#f4f4f5}h4{color:#a1a1aa;border-top-color:rgba(255,255,255,.12)}code{background:rgba(255,255,255,.1)}}</style></head><body><ul><li>Every stream's tab strip starts with a small pinned tab: the pond room. It shows what each thread in the pond is working on right now, as short lines rather than every edit and command, plus "needs you" and "finished" notes. Turn on "Show agent talk" to see threads coordinating with each other, and type in it to talk to the room like a group chat.</li><li>Adding your iPhone or a browser is just signing in with the same account: the QR code and pairing codes are gone from Settings and setup.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.28.0</h4><ul><li>Invite people to a pond by email: type their addresses, pick Member or Viewer, and send. Whoever signs in with that address joins straight away; anyone else is told the invite is for someone else. Codes and QR are gone from the invite sheet (Copy invite link is still there).</li><li>Pond membership follows the person's account: once someone is in a pond, every device they sign in on (browser, Mac) shows it, with no second invite. People lists each person once with how many devices they use, and pond settings show your own devices with Remove.</li></ul><h4>Also in 2.27.12</h4><ul><li>A chat no longer shows Working while only a duckling is working, whether Claude is waiting on it or has finished its part. The ducklings bar shows the work and has its own Stop.</li></ul></body></html>]]></description>
